50,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Meridian's fixed configuration and regional team sound stable, but Anchor's on-site engineering is tempting for the depot.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Anchor is the only one that feels like it respects the yard and the peak-season reality.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,May,,Tessera's partner-led training sounds like the 2018 data lift disaster. I prefer Anchor or Meridian.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Anchor's engineering team being present through rollout addresses my fear about the staff and retirements.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Corvus is a modular nightmare. Meridian is safe, but Anchor's on-premise model might be a one-time capital hit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, would the board prefer Anchor's one-time cost or Meridian's hosted fee?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I don't care about the board; I care that the system doesn't crash in December.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,May,,Anchor's specific focus on transport operators is a huge plus over a general suite.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning toward Anchor. Having the engineers here is the only way to ensure it sticks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The board hates capital requests, but they hate unpredictable operating costs more. Anchor is a calculated risk.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Anchor seems to solve the ownership and implementation gaps best.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting Anchor.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,May,,I'll go with Anchor too.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Anchor it is.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall join the consensus. Logic dictates the specialized tool is the most robust choice.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
